      "y": 895,
      "width": 2500,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "1. STORIES-FIRST FLOW: No dashboard. One story at a time until all reach 10/10, then move to Points\n2. JOURNEY CARD: Added /live-style \"Your journey to feel understood\" card with round numbers and dot ratings (●●●●●●●○○○)\n3. OPTIONS NOT CHAT: Replaced open chat with A/B/C/D/Other choice buttons (per algorithm spec)\n4. 10/10 GATE: Stories must reach 10/10 to save (can reject entirely). Points must reach 10/10 or 7+ with explicit \"Keep anyway\" choice\n5. SEQUENTIAL REVIEW: Screen 3 = Story 1, Screen 4 = Transition (\"Stories captured, now Points\"), Screen 5 = Point 1, Screen 6 = Publish\n6. LEARNING CAPTURE: After reaching 10/10, AI asks \"What made you agree more?\" with options to learn what worked\n7. Story rating = 10/10 (not 9/10), Point rating = 10/10 (both achieved perfect alignment)",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid"
